      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbd0403f96cde19ff45c539d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是悔恨……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b29c68f503cd557e5c15e72c77fc3ec1137766fbb3739c0d0e9300cd943e20f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84ad863f88d92a1f8966ac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40bfa8672a68bb32b7b579d32c39426280ef0191ad6669cce5aba49d08ddc042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f0cae98f6210392fd3efc3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢优雅古典的服装……\r\n因为不会受流行风潮的影响，\r\n可以长久地穿下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba94d1379107b9612ba534a13822155b47140c47f7b73a0812ca50beec0f1329",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28184fa28bc75b016e3d09d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奶奶也称赞这套衣服很适合我，\r\n让我觉得很开心……\r\n呵呵，所以总是会不自觉地想穿它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ad68db4b348beb0ede88740b2c3ca7c1f793722817ceba7a7851863bf4bb85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d9f31e2c328bb2b6a75ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前约好要一起去看的电影，\r\n最近终于正式上映了！\r\n请问你何时方便呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf2080c95e15ac09d08ff8ec2835441e35483a7fbf9e0f477fee9756d93a590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ead0dea085392d016bf9a0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是平手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c12ac5317481cfc712db8f78b7550685943b2692c3ba858637f37c51a4d9bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50acffc5b5bb802e34fceb87",
